BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Media School
DTSTART:20260827T230000Z
DTEND:20260828T000000Z
LOCATION:SIMON SKJODT ASSEMBLY HALL
GEO:39.180877;-86.522213
SUMMARY:Special Sneak Peek Screening of 'Timeless: Don Fischer's Half-Cen
 tury Broadcasting IU Sports'
DESCRIPTION:For more than 50 years\, Don Fischer's voice has provided the
  soundtrack to Indiana University athletics\, narrating championships\, b
 uzzer-beaters\, game-winning drives\, and unforgettable Hoosier moments f
 or generations of fans.  On August 28\, WTIU will premiere Timeless: Don 
 Fischer's Half-Century Broadcasting IU Sports\, a new documentary from In
 diana Public Media celebrating one of the most recognizable voices in col
 lege sports broadcasting.  Before the statewide television premiere\, fan
 s will have an opportunity to experience the film in one of the most icon
 ic venues in Indiana University athletics.  The event will give fans an o
 pportunity to celebrate Don Fischer's remarkable career in the home of IU
  Basketball\, where so many of the moments featured in the documentary fi
 rst unfolded.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  For more than 50 years\, Don Fischer's 
 voice has provided the soundtrack to Indiana University athletics\, narra
 ting championships\, buzzer-beaters\, game-winning drives\, and unforgett
 able Hoosier moments for generations of fans.</p><p>  On August 28\, WTIU
  will premiere <em>Timeless: Don Fischer's Half-Century Broadcasting IU S
 ports</em>\, a new documentary from Indiana Public Media celebrating one 
 of the most recognizable voices in college sports broadcasting.</p><p>  B
 efore the statewide television premiere\, fans will have an opportunity t
 o experience the film in one of the most iconic venues in Indiana Univers
 ity athletics.</p><p>  The event will give fans an opportunity to celebra
 te Don Fischer's remarkable career in the home of IU Basketball\, where s
 o many of the moments featured in the documentary first unfolded.</p>
UID:20260827T230000Z-2386305@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260819T094840Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/mediaiub/event/2386305-special-sneak-peek-scree
 ning-of-timeless-don
CATEGORIES:Performances, shows, and films,Sporting events
LAST-MODIFIED:20260819T134840Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/45/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,558,536/32069_Don_Fischer.rev.1787146148.png
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2386305
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/45/width/168/heigh
 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,558\,536/32069_Don_Fischer.rev.1787146148.p
 ng
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Timeless: Don Fischer's Half-Century Broadcasti
 ng IU Sports
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>Jesse Loudenbarger<br />\nMarketing Director<
 br />\nIndiana Public Media<br />\njloudenb@iu.edu<br />\n(812) 855-2119<
 /p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Special sneak-peek screening planned at Simon Skjo
 dt Assembly Hall before statewide television premiere.</p>
