 ew) for a relaxed networking event. Wear your best IU gear and join us fo
 r snacks as you connect with employers in a friendly\, low-pressure setti
 ng. Come and go as your schedule allows!Monday\, September 215:30 -7 p.m.
  at Ernie Pyle Hall\, 1st floor commons
