 king event. Wear your best IU gear and join us for snacks as you connect 
 with employers in a friendly\, low-pressure setting. Come and go as your 
 schedule allows!</p><ul><li><strong>Monday\, September 21</strong></li><l
 i><strong>5:30 -7 p.m. at Ernie Pyle Hall\, 1st floor commons</strong></l
 i></ul>
