BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Media School
DTSTART:20260922T180000Z
DTEND:20260922T220000Z
LOCATION:INDIANA MEMORIAL UNION (UNION BUILDING)
GEO:39.167655;-86.523537
SUMMARY:Fall Career + Internship Fair: College & O'Neill
DESCRIPTION:Whether you want to explore great internship opportunities\, 
 find open positions for your first full-time post-grad job or make profes
 sional connections\, the career fair has something for you!    Prepare fo
 r the fair:Download the Handshake App (https://careers.college.indiana.ed
 u/about/explore-our-center/handshake/index.html) before you arrive. View 
 participating employers and the positions they're recruiting you for!    
   Meet with a career coach (https://careers.college.indiana.edu/career-pr
 ep-outcomes/career-coaching/index.html) to review your resume or practice
  talking to employers.      Dress to make a good impression – see our e
 xamples (https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercareers/career-fair-outfits/)!
       When you arrive:You'll check in at the entrance and get a name tag.
  There will be a place to set your stuff down\, if needed.      Feeling a
  little nervous? We'll have career coaches on site to answer any question
 s and help boost your confidence.      There's more to the fair!Drop by E
 rnie Pyle Hall any weekday between 10 a.m. and 4 p.m. for tips on how to 
 give your Handshake and LinkedIn profiles a glow-up\, prep your résumé\
 , practice your pitch\, and make a lasting impression on employers. Can't
  make it? Learn more about connecting with employers. (https://careers.co
 llege.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcomes/connect-with-employers/index.html)
 The night before the fair\, swing by the Career Fair Kickoff: Employer Me
 et &amp\; Greet from 5:30-7 p.m. on September 21. You'll be able to meet 
 employers who will be attending the career fair the next day. It'll be ca
 sual\, low-pressure\, and fun!          This event is Momentum eligible
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div class="sc-hgBypa fgxsNL"></div><div cla
 ss="sc-eXJteL kOnyhP"><div><p>      Whether you want to explore great int
 ernship opportunities\, find open positions for your first full-time post
 -grad job or make professional connections\, the career fair has somethin
 g for you!    </p><p><strong>Prepare for the fair:</strong></p><ul><li><a
  href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/hands
 hake/index.html">Download the Handshake App</a> before you arrive. View p
 articipating employers and the positions they're recruiting you for!     
  </li><li><a href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcom
 es/career-coaching/index.html">Meet with a career coach</a> to review you
 r resume or practice talking to employers.      </li><li>Dress to make a 
 good impression – <a title="Link: https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercar
 eers/career-fair-outfits/" href="https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercareer
 s/career-fair-outfits/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">see our e
 xamples</a>!      </li></ul><p><strong>When you arrive:</strong></p><ul><
 li>You'll check in at the entrance and get a name tag. There will be a pl
 ace to set your stuff down\, if needed.      </li><li>Feeling a little ne
 rvous? We'll have career coaches on site to answer any questions and help
  boost your confidence.      </li></ul><p><strong>There's more to the fai
 r!</strong></p><ul><li>Drop by Ernie Pyle Hall any weekday between 10 a.m
 . and 4 p.m. for tips on how to give your Handshake and LinkedIn profiles
  a glow-up\, prep your résumé\, practice your pitch\, and make a lastin
 g impression on employers. Can't make it? <a title="Link: https://careers
 .college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcomes/connect-with-employers/index.ht
 ml" href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcomes/connec
 t-with-employers/index.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Lear
 n more about connecting with employers.</a></li></ul><ul><li>The night be
 fore the fair\, swing by the <strong>Career Fair Kickoff: Employer Meet &
 amp\; Greet</strong> from 5:30-7 p.m. on September 21. You'll be able to 
 meet employers who will be attending the career fair the next day. It'll 
 be casual\, low-pressure\, and fun!      </li></ul><br />    This event i
 s Momentum eligible  </div></div>
UID:20260922T180000Z-2371587@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260806T113846Z
